<%- include('partials/head') %>
<div class="hero">
  <div class="mark-lg">G</div>
  <h1>GTAMP</h1>
  <p class="sub">GTAMP is a multiplayer-enabled modification framework for Grand Theft Auto V, built from our own code.</p>
  <div class="live-badge"><span class="live-dot"></span> Join the <%= livePlayers %> people playing right now!</div>
  <a href="/download/GTAMP-Launcher-v1.6.0.exe" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">DOWNLOAD GTAMP</a>
  <div class="terms">By downloading, you agree to the terms of the GTAMP License.</div>
  <a href="/run-server" class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" style="margin-top:14px">CREATE YOUR OWN SERVER</a>
</div>

<section id="features">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="section-title center">What we have for you</h2>
    <div class="grid g2 feature-grid">
      <div class="card feat"><div class="feat-icon">&#9729;</div><h3>Streaming</h3><p>GTAMP lets servers use custom cars, maps, weapons, and more dynamically.</p></div>
      <div class="card feat"><div class="feat-icon">&#9733;</div><h3>Sync quality</h3><p>Built-in multiplayer relay keeps players in sync over your own server.</p></div>
      <div class="card feat"><div class="feat-icon">&#10022;</div><h3>Standalone</h3><p>GTAMP doesn't modify your GTA V installation, so switching is easy.</p></div>
      <div class="card feat"><div class="feat-icon">&#9835;</div><h3>Endless possibilities</h3><p>Roleplay, drifting, racing, deathmatch, or something completely original.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="requirements" class="alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="section-title center">System requirements</h2>
    <div class="req-grid">
      <div class="req">
        <div class="req-head">Minimum <span class="muted">&mdash; Windows 10</span></div>
        <table>
          <tr><td>CPU</td><td><b>Intel Core i5-3470 / AMD FX-6300</b></td></tr>
          <tr><td>GPU</td><td><b>NVIDIA GTX 660 / Radeon HD 7870</b></td></tr>
          <tr><td>RAM</td><td><b>8 GB</b></td></tr>
          <tr><td>HDD</td><td><b>110 GB + 4 GB</b></td></tr>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class="req">
        <div class="req-head">Recommended <span class="muted">&mdash; Windows 11</span></div>
        <table>
          <tr><td>CPU</td><td><b>Intel Core i7-4790 / Ryzen 5 1600</b></td></tr>
          <tr><td>GPU</td><td><b>NVIDIA GTX 1060 / RX 580</b></td></tr>
          <tr><td>RAM</td><td><b>16 GB</b></td></tr>
          <tr><td>HDD</td><td><b>110 GB + 8 GB SSD</b></td></tr>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="developers">
  <div class="wrap center">
    <h2 class="section-title">We <span style="color:#e05aa0">&#10084;</span> developers</h2>
    <div class="grid g3 mt">
      <div class="card feat"><h3>Run your own server!</h3><p>GTAMP is built for creativity. Create your own server and make your dreams come true.</p><a href="/run-server" class="btn btn-accent mt">CREATE A SERVER NOW</a></div>
      <div class="card feat"><h3>Develop in your favorite language</h3><p>Lua, JavaScript, and more. Everyone can get started quickly.</p><a href="/docs/scripting" class="btn btn-ghost mt">LEARN TO SCRIPT</a></div>
      <div class="card feat"><h3>Contribute to GTAMP</h3><p>As a community platform, we appreciate everyone who contributes features, resources, and research.</p><a href="/docs" class="btn btn-ghost mt">READ MORE</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="faq" class="alt">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px">
    <h2 class="section-title center">F.A.Q.</h2>
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Will I get banned from GTA Online for playing GTAMP?</div><div class="faq-a">No, GTAMP does not interact with Rockstar Games Online Services other than to validate your game copy the first time you launch it.</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Is GTAMP the same as FiveM?</div><div class="faq-a">No. GTAMP is inspired by FiveM's architecture but is an entirely separate, own codebase.</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Can I run my own server?</div><div class="faq-a">Yes. Click "Create a server now", install the artifacts, and follow the docs.</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">I want to run a server, how can I do so?</div><div class="faq-a">Refer to our <a href="/run-server">server page</a> to get started. Our community is there to help.</div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/foot') %>
